' Component/Tree Diagram 03 — GHOST heaviest-subtree selection (worked example).
'
' The small weighted tree from the Wolfram witness
' (formal/wolfram/fork_choice/ghost_heaviest_subtree.wl):
'   children : 0 → {1,2}, 1 → {3,4}, 2 → {5}
'   wt       : 0=0, 1=3, 2=2, 3=5, 4=1, 5=4        (supporting weight at node)
'   subScore : 1=9, 2=6, 3=5, 4=1, 5=4  (subScore[0]=15 = wt + Σ children)
'
' At each level the estimator descends into the child of MAX cumulative subtree
' score (ties → lower hash, a total order). Chosen path: 0 → 1 (9>6) → 3 (5>1),
' heaviest-subtree leaf = 3. This matches rank_forkchoices' fixpoint.
'
' Render:
'   plantuml -tsvg docs/theory/fork-choice/diagrams/03-ghost-heaviest-subtree.puml

@startuml 03-ghost-heaviest-subtree
!theme plain

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #333333
  FontName    "monospace"
  FontSize    10
}
skinparam legendFontName "monospace"
skinparam legendFontSize 10
skinparam legendBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam legendBorderColor #666666
skinparam defaultFontName "monospace"
skinparam defaultFontSize 10

title GHOST heaviest-subtree selection

' Node color legend:
'   green  (#A5D6A7) = CHOSEN heaviest-subtree path (0 → 1 → 3)
'   white  (#FFFFFF) = not chosen
' Edge color legend:
'   green  (#2E7D32) = chosen descent (max cumulative score wins)
'   gray   (#90A4AE) = not-chosen child

rectangle "block 0  (root / LCA)\nwt = 0\nsubScore = 15" as N0 #A5D6A7
rectangle "block 1  ◀ chosen\nwt = 3\nsubScore = 9" as N1 #A5D6A7
rectangle "block 2\nwt = 2\nsubScore = 6" as N2 #FFFFFF
rectangle "block 3  ◀ HEAVIEST LEAF\nwt = 5\nsubScore = 5" as N3 #A5D6A7
rectangle "block 4  (leaf)\nwt = 1\nsubScore = 1" as N4 #FFFFFF
rectangle "block 5  (leaf)\nwt = 4\nsubScore = 4" as N5 #FFFFFF

N0 -[#2E7D32,bold]-> N1 : 9 ≥ 6  ⟹ pick 1
N0 -[#90A4AE]-> N2 : 6  (dropped)
N1 -[#2E7D32,bold]-> N3 : 5 ≥ 1  ⟹ pick 3
N1 -[#90A4AE]-> N4 : 1  (dropped)
N2 -[#90A4AE]-> N5 : 4  (off the\nheaviest path)

legend bottom
  At each level DESCEND into the max-cumulative-score child;
  ties → lower hash (a TOTAL order, so the argmax is unique).
  subScore[n] = wt[n] + Σ subScore[children(n)].
  Path 0 → 1 → 3 : subScore 15 ▶ 9 ▶ 5 ; heaviest-subtree leaf = 3.
  Rocq Rank.rank_selects_heaviest ; Wolfram ghost_heaviest_subtree.wl.
endlegend

@enduml
